\f1\b\fs56 \cf0 7. Closing summary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 Your profile does not simply describe a \'93dark\'94 leadership style. It suggests 
\f1\b strategic toughness moderated by substantial humility, empathy, and ethical aspiration
\f0\b0 . You may be particularly effective when circumstances require composure, realism, political awareness, and difficult choices.\
Your main vulnerability is likely the gap between 
\f1\b ethical intent and interpersonal impact
\f0\b0 , especially when urgency, resistance, or high stakes activate a more controlling and instrumental mode. The most valuable development target is therefore not becoming less decisive. It is becoming 
\f1\b more transparent, challengeable, and deliberate while remaining decisive
\f0\b0 .\
The clearest test of progress will not be a lower questionnaire score. It will be whether colleagues increasingly bring you bad news early, disagree with you safely, receive appropriate credit, understand how decisions were made, and experience prompt repair when your impact does not match your intent.\
